      "en": "Then Hazael king of Syria went up and fought against Gath, and took it; and Hazael set his face to go up to Jerusalem.",
      "ko": "때에 아람 왕 하사엘이 올라와서 가드를 쳐서 취하고 예루살렘을 향하여 올라오고자 한고로",
      "source_text_hash": "9ddedab3cb4d779d3019d93aef2510637f23aebc8cb9f05568e30c141dcf5552",
      "translation_text_hash": "a4420678a145da1d67efb25192b144049199ece06e730f9cf04f0b0607983ff1",
